- Slice 3 must land before this branch ships. Until then, a restarted or reset durable session's first publication moves HEAD off the recovered snapshot.
- On Node, a reused process id would still be mistaken for a live owner. That is inherent to a pid-file lock; the JVM and Dart use real operating-system locks.
